{"t_ms": 528203, "conversation_id": "v2llm_streaming_retrieve_s020", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Cancellation Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests may cancel their reservation up to 48 hours before the scheduled check-in date without any cancellation charges. Cancellations made within 48 hours of arrival may incur a one-night room charge. Refund processing timelines depend on the original payment method. Special promotional and non-refundable bookings are not eligible for cancellation.", "Lost & Found Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nItems found within the hotel premises are recorded and securely stored by the housekeeping department. Guests who believe they have misplaced personal belongings should contact the Front Desk with a detailed description of the item. Unclaimed items are generally retained for 90 days before being disposed of in accordance with hotel policy.", "Late Check-out Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nLate check-out is available upon request and depends on room availability. Guests checking out between 11:00 AM and 2:00 PM may be charged a partial room rate. Check-outs after 2:00 PM are generally charged as a full night's stay. Guests are advised to contact the Front Desk at least one day in advance to request a late check-out."], "scores": [0.5161172747612, 0.7523179054260254, 0.7737705707550049], "filenames": ["51_cancellation.txt", "09_lost_and_found.txt", "04_late_checkout.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 72, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
